{"seq":3,"slug":"higher-order-monads","title":"高阶函数与 Monad","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/scala-language/functional/higher-order-monads","wordCount":1116,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"高阶函数与-monad\">高阶函数与 Monad</h1><p>第一次见到 <code>Option</code>、<code>List</code>、<code>Future</code> 都有 <code>map</code> 和 <code>flatMap</code>，很多人以为只是巧合。其实这是 Scala 函数式设计里最深的一条暗线：这些看似无关的类型共享同一套组合规律，于是能用同一套写法（尤其是 for 推导）操作。把这条暗线挑明，就是 Monad。本篇从把函数当值传递讲起，经由 for 推导，最终抵达 Monad 这个统一抽象——它也是通往第三章类型类的桥梁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>函数式编程有两块基石。第一块是高阶函数：函数可以像数字一样被当作参数传入、当作结果返回。第二块是「带上下文的值」的统一组合方式：<code>Option</code> 是「可能没有的值」、<code>List</code> 是「多个值」、<code>Future</code> 是「未来才有的值」，它们都提供 <code>map</code>（变换内部值）与 <code>flatMap</code>（变换并展平嵌套），而 Monad 正是对这套接口的抽象命名。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[高阶函数&lt;br/&gt;函数作为值] --&gt; B[map: 变换容器内的值]&#10;  A --&gt; C[flatMap: 变换并展平]&#10;  B --&gt; D[Functor 规律]&#10;  C --&gt; E[Monad 规律]&#10;  E --&gt; F[for 推导&lt;br/&gt;嵌套 flatMap 的语法糖]&#10;  F --&gt; G[Option/List/Future/Either&lt;br/&gt;共享同一写法]&#10;  E --&gt; H[通往类型类抽象]\">flowchart TD\n  A[高阶函数&lt;br/&gt;函数作为值] --&gt; B[map: 变换容器内的值]\n  A --&gt; C[flatMap: 变换并展平]\n  B --&gt; D[Functor 规律]\n  C --&gt; E[Monad 规律]\n  E --&gt; F[for 推导&lt;br/&gt;嵌套 flatMap 的语法糖]\n  F --&gt; G[Option/List/Future/Either&lt;br/&gt;共享同一写法]\n  E --&gt; H[通往类型类抽象]</pre><p>下表把几个常见的「带上下文的值」放在一起，凸显它们共享的接口：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>表示的上下文</th>\n<th><code>map</code> 的含义</th>\n<th><code>flatMap</code> 的含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Option[A]</code></td>\n<td>可能缺失</td>\n<td>有值时变换</td>\n<td>链接可能缺失的步骤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>List[A]</code></td>\n<td>零或多个</td>\n<td>逐元素变换</td>\n<td>笛卡尔式展开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Either[E, A]</code></td>\n<td>成功或失败</td>\n<td>成功时变换</td>\n<td>短路错误传播</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Future[A]</code></td>\n<td>异步结果</td>\n<td>完成后变换</td>\n<td>串联异步步骤</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"高阶函数-把函数当值\">高阶函数：把函数当值</h2><p>Scala 里函数是一等公民——既是值，也是带 <code>apply</code> 方法的对象（呼应 <a href=\"../foundations/oop-fp-fusion\">面向对象与函数式融合</a> 的统一模型）。这让你能把行为作为参数传进去，把通用的「遍历/筛选/聚合」骨架与具体逻辑解耦。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"scala\" data-code=\"def twice(f: Int =&gt; Int, x: Int): Int = f(f(x))&#10;twice(_ + 3, 10)            // 16，把「加 3」当值传入&#10;&#10;val nums = List(1, 2, 3, 4)&#10;nums.filter(_ % 2 == 0)     // List(2, 4)&#10;nums.map(_ * 10)            // List(10, 20, 30, 40)&#10;nums.foldLeft(0)(_ + _)     // 10，把「相加」当值，从 0 开始累积\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>def twice(f: Int => Int, x: Int): Int = f(f(x))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>twice(_ + 3, 10)            // 16，把「加 3」当值传入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val nums = List(1, 2, 3, 4)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>nums.filter(_ % 2 == 0)     // List(2, 4)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>nums.map(_ * 10)            // List(10, 20, 30, 40)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>nums.foldLeft(0)(_ + _)     // 10，把「相加」当值，从 0 开始累积</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>_ + 3</code> 是匿名函数的简写，<code>foldLeft</code> 则把「初始值 + 二元操作」参数化，从而用一个方法表达所有线性聚合。这些正是 <a href=\"immutability-collections\">不可变与集合</a> 里那些声明式变换得以成立的底层能力：集合方法之所以强大，正因为它们接受函数作为参数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"flatmap-与-for-推导\">flatMap 与 for 推导</h2><p><code>map</code> 能变换容器内的值，但当变换本身又返回一个容器时就会嵌套：<code>Option[Option[A]]</code>。<code>flatMap</code> 在变换后顺手展平一层，避免嵌套。当你需要串联多个「带上下文」的步骤时，手写 <code>flatMap</code> 很快会变成右移的金字塔：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"scala\" data-code=\"def parse(s: String): Option[Int] = s.toIntOption&#10;// 嵌套 flatMap：可读性差&#10;parse(&quot;2&quot;).flatMap(a =&gt; parse(&quot;3&quot;).flatMap(b =&gt; parse(&quot;4&quot;).map(c =&gt; a + b + c)))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>def parse(s: String): Option[Int] = s.toIntOption</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 嵌套 flatMap：可读性差</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>parse(\"2\").flatMap(a => parse(\"3\").flatMap(b => parse(\"4\").map(c => a + b + c)))</span></span></code></pre></div><p>for 推导是这串 <code>flatMap</code>/<code>map</code> 的语法糖，把它拉平成顺序阅读的代码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"scala\" data-code=\"val result: Option[Int] =&#10;  for&#10;    a &lt;- parse(&quot;2&quot;)&#10;    b &lt;- parse(&quot;3&quot;)&#10;    c &lt;- parse(&quot;4&quot;)&#10;  yield a + b + c&#10;// Some(9)；任一步 parse 返回 None，整个结果就是 None（自动短路）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val result: Option[Int] =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    a &#x3C;- parse(\"2\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    b &#x3C;- parse(\"3\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    c &#x3C;- parse(\"4\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  yield a + b + c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Some(9)；任一步 parse 返回 None，整个结果就是 None（自动短路）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键在于：这段 for 推导对 <code>Option</code> 成立，把所有 <code>parse</code> 换成返回 <code>List</code> 或 <code>Future</code> 的函数，同一套写法依然成立——只是「展平」的语义随类型而变（List 是组合展开，Future 是异步串联）。这正是 <a href=\"pattern-matching\">模式匹配</a> 里 for 推导支持模式的同一套机制的延伸：for 是对 <code>flatMap</code>/<code>map</code>/<code>withFilter</code> 的纯语法翻译。</p>\n<h2 id=\"monad-把共性挑明\">Monad：把共性挑明</h2><p>当不同类型都满足「有 <code>flatMap</code> 和一个包装值的构造（如 <code>Some</code>、<code>List.apply</code>），且满足三条代数规律」时，我们就说它们是 Monad。这三条规律是左单位元、右单位元与结合律，用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{pure}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">pure</span></span></span></span></span></span> 表示包装、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;\\!\\!&gt;\\!=</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span></span></span></span> 表示 flatMap，可写作：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{pure}(a) &gt;\\!\\!&gt;\\!= f \\;=\\; f(a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">pure</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mtext>  </mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m &gt;\\!\\!&gt;\\!= \\mathrm{pure} \\;=\\; m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">pure</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>m</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(m &gt;\\!\\!&gt;\\!= f) &gt;\\!\\!&gt;\\!= g \\;=\\; m &gt;\\!\\!&gt;\\!= (x \\Rightarrow f(x) &gt;\\!\\!&gt;\\!= g)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这些规律保证了 for 推导的行为可预测、可重构——比如你能放心地把连续步骤拆分或合并而不改变语义。它们不是装饰，而是「为什么这些类型能共用一套写法」的根本原因。</p>\n<p>但到这里有个未解决的问题：在纯 Scala 里，<code>Option</code> 和 <code>List</code> 各自定义了 <code>flatMap</code>，却没有一个统一的接口把「是 Monad」这件事抽象出来，让你写出对任意 Monad 都成立的通用代码。解决它需要类型类——用 <code>given</code> 实例为已有类型「事后」声明「它是个 Monad」。这正是第三章的主题：<a href=\"../type-system/type-classes\">类型类</a> 会把这里的 Monad 概念从「巧合的共性」升级为「可编程的抽象」，而它依赖的机制见 <a href=\"../type-system/implicits-givens\">隐式与 given</a>。第四章的 Cats Effect 与 ZIO 则把 Monad 用到副作用上，见 <a href=\"../ecosystem/concurrency-effects\">并发与效应系统</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>高阶函数让函数成为可传递的值，是集合声明式变换与一切组合抽象的底层能力。</li>\n<li><code>map</code> 变换容器内的值，<code>flatMap</code> 变换并展平，避免「带上下文的值」嵌套。</li>\n<li>for 推导是 <code>flatMap</code>/<code>map</code>/<code>withFilter</code> 的语法糖，让串联多个带上下文步骤的代码顺序可读，并对所有 Monad 通用。</li>\n<li>Monad 是对「有 flatMap + pure 且满足三条规律」的抽象，这三条规律保证 for 推导可预测、可重构。</li>\n<li>把 Monad 升级为可编程抽象要靠 <a href=\"../type-system/type-classes\">类型类</a> 与 <a href=\"../type-system/implicits-givens\">隐式与 given</a>；用于副作用见 <a href=\"../ecosystem/concurrency-effects\">并发与效应系统</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高阶函数与 Monad","id":"高阶函数与-monad"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"高阶函数：把函数当值","id":"高阶函数-把函数当值"},{"level":2,"text":"flatMap 与 for 推导","id":"flatmap-与-for-推导"},{"level":2,"text":"Monad：把共性挑明","id":"monad-把共性挑明"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"模式匹配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/scala-language/functional/pattern-matching"},"next":{"title":"高级类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/scala-language/type-system/advanced-types"}}